        <groundspeak:log id="629941860">
          <groundspeak:date>2016-08-19T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="1685537">nosweat6060</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP285 Cardston

This was an early morning find as I try to find 5 different &quot;icons&quot; before the sun sets. I was even lucky to meet a local muggle who wondered what was so interesting. I hope to return soon and search for the three remaining caps in this area. Thanks to outforthehunt for this incredible series.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="528920519">
