          <groundspeak:finder id="664594">Sears Tower</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP285 - Cardston&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#10 of 13 today.  On the way here, I had to drive by the mud bog pit where a competition was underway.  Stopped alongside the road to watch a couple.  TFTH&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
