          <groundspeak:finder id="2582877">manjalou</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP285 Cardston&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We had spent the week camping at Cardston. We were out for a drive and stopped for this cap. I don't think our muggle friends who we are camping with understand our obsession with these caps. &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt;. Thank you outforthehunt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This entry was edited by manjalou on Saturday, 25 July 2015 at 21:17:13 UTC.&lt;/p&gt;

